1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:14,580
I asked you what you dream of

2
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:18,120
You didn't say a word

3
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:23,000
Now I walk the way you walked

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,680
And hear what you have heard

5
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:30,360
There's a beat inside your hands

6
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:34,460
You never let me hear

7
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:37,580
Three steps behind you

8
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:41,680
I'm counting too

9
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:44,820
Every step you took

10
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:49,500
Is leading me to you

11
00:00:56,720 --> 00:01:00,540
The city's waking up now

12
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:04,680
A thousand hurried feet

13
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:09,080
But in the noise I only hear

14
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:12,680
The count you never speak

15
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:16,580
I don't have the words to say

16
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:20,020
So I'm bringing flowers instead

17
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:24,500
Three steps behind you

18
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:27,360
I'm counting too

19
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:31,760
Every light you left on

20
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:35,380
Is leading me to you

21
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:39,660
Down the hall the monitors

22
00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:44,300
Are keeping someone's time

23
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:47,680
Every heart in here is counting

24
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:51,000
Yours, and hers, and mine
